        "quote": "Provided, that the aggregate of all citywide levies of said city, except levies for the payment of bonds and interest thereon and levies for such other special purposes as authorized by law, is hereby limited to 32.75 mills on each dollar of assessed tangible valuation of said city. (C.O. 54 § 1, 10-26-81; C.O. 41 § 1, 3-12-78; C.O. 8 § 1, 8-14-67; C.O. 2 § 2, 5-28-63.)",
